According to our records, 6 Larch Grove is **not** in a conservation area. It is also not a listed building and has no tree preservation order.

On windows, the council guidance says that replacement windows in a conservation area need planning permission unless they match the existing windows in material and pattern. Since this property is not in a conservation area, that specific requirement doesn't apply, so you would not normally need an application just to replace the windows.

